    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;be the set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;for which the mean deviation about the mean of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> consecutive positive integers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>100</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math> . Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is"
  },
